<title>PERU: Telefonica del Peru sets dates for dividend.</title>
<headline>Telefonica del Peru sets dates for dividend.</headline>
<dateline>LIMA 1997-05-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>Peru's Telefonica del Peru has set a June 12 record date and July 1 payout date for its cash dividend of 0.11359 sol per share based on 1996 profits, the Lima Stock Exchange said Thursday.</p>
<p>Telefonica is majority-owned by Spain's Telefonica de Espana after its $2.002 billion privatization in 1994.</p>
<p>((-- Lima newsroom, 511 221-2134))</p>
</text>
